Subject: [PATCH 07/20] ahsh: unbind Ctrl+L ClearScreen in product key maps

Product setup_keybindings removes reedline Ctrl+L ClearScreen after
Nu defaults so host goto_split can own the chord on pass-through.
Issue 26080510416061 Exp 1. Tests drive build_product_keybindings.
